OL,3,AI earn #120,000 a year making social
OL,4,Amedia videos go viral
OL,5,
OL,6,FEknoor Singh says he only needs his
OL,7,Fmobile phone and a decent internet
OL,8,Fconnection to earn more than #120,000 a
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FThe 22-year-old Londoner is a
OL,12,Fprofessional "clipper". He is paid by
OL,13,Fclients to make short, vertical videos
OL,14,Ffor social media, in the hope of them
OL,15,Fgoing viral.
OL,17,F"The more views a clip gets, the more
OL,18,Fmoney I make," he says.
