OL,3,AI earn #120,000 a year making social
OL,4,Amedia videos go viral
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe way it typically works is that the
OL,7,Fclient - who could be anyone from a
OL,8,Fclothing brand to a record label, movie
OL,9,Fstudio, podcaster or influencer - has a
OL,10,Flonger video that the clipper watches
OL,11,Ffirst.
